/*
  AutopilotSection.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0165 · AutopilotSection (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native `AutopilotSection`
  resolves (table "AutopilotSection") lives here with its web `t(key, default)` English value. These
  entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept
