  catalog.

  The first group is the exact keys extracted from the web source
  (features/driving/components/driving-dynamics/AutopilotSection.tsx). The remainder back the native
  state envelope (freshness chip, connectivity banner, loading / empty / error chrome), the embedded
  em-dash the web writes inline, and the accessibility copy.
*/

